# paths ripgrep skips in this checkout. rg reads this file like .gitignore, and
# a path named on the command line (`rg x docs/book`) is still searched, as is
# everything with `--no-ignore`.

# vendored mermaid bundle for the mdBook build: one 2.5 MB line that matches
# almost any short pattern and floods the output
docs/dev-docs/mermaid.min.js

# local-only trees that are not part of the repository: the generated mdBook
# html (the source is docs/dev-docs/) and loose research notes. rg would
# otherwise search the minified js and search index in the html
docs/book/
docs/research/
